{"id":2725,"date":"2026-06-11T14:25:49","date_gmt":"2026-06-11T14:25:49","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/?post_type=product&#038;p=2725"},"modified":"2026-10-02T06:49:22","modified_gmt":"2026-10-02T06:49:22","slug":"magenta-red-sandstone-semi-polish","status":"publish","type":"product","link":"https:\/\/stonesandtiles.in\/product\/magenta-red-sandstone-semi-polish\/","title":{"rendered":"Magenta Red Sandstone Semi Polish"},"content":{"rendered":"<p data-start=\"348\" data-end=\"717\">Magenta Red Sandstone Semi Polish is a premium natural sandstone renowned for its vibrant red hues, subtle magenta undertones, and elegant semi-polished finish. The refined surface enhances the stone&#8217;s natural color variations while preserving its authentic texture, creating a sophisticated appearance that complements both modern and traditional architectural styles.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"719\" data-end=\"1075\">Widely preferred by architects, builders, landscape designers, and homeowners, this sandstone offers exceptional versatility across a variety of interior and exterior applications. Whether used for flooring, wall cladding, pathways, courtyards, terraces, garden landscapes, or feature walls, it brings warmth, character, and timeless beauty to every space.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1077\" data-end=\"1381\">Known for its durability, strength, and low maintenance requirements, Magenta Red Sandstone performs exceptionally well in residential, commercial, and outdoor environments. Its natural color variations and distinctive patterns ensure that every installation possesses a unique and attractive appearance.<\/p>\n<p data-start=\"1383\" data-end=\"1588\">Combining durability, aesthetic appeal, and long-lasting performance, Magenta Red Sandstone Semi Polish remains a preferred choice for projects seeking a premium natural stone solution with enduring value.<\/p>\n<h2 data-section-id=\"4zmfa9\" data-start=\"1590\" data-end=\"1611\">Product Attributes<\/h2>\n<div clas